(7177742, 1102787, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this is excellent! :)</td>', 'Yeah, this is excellent! :)', '2014-02-17 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177745, 1102711, 22459, '<td valign="top">Creepy!</td>', 'Creepy!', '2014-02-17 00:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177746, 1102783, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me smile!  Thanks!</td>', 'Made me smile!  Thanks!', '2014-02-17 00:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177747, 1102896, 30982, '<td valign="top">They look so prim and proper.  Ladies on their way to work.  Wonderful tones!</td>', 'They look so prim and proper.  Ladies on their way to work.  Wonderful tones!', '2014-02-17 00:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177749, 1102381, 30982, '<td valign="top">So very engrossed!  One wonders if they''re watching some sort of sporting event!</td>', 'So very engrossed!  One wonders if they''re watching some sort of sporting event!', '2014-02-17 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177750, 1102702, 30982, '<td valign="top">Marilyn''s younger sister was often overlooked...</td>', 'Marilyn''s younger sister was often overlooked...', '2014-02-17 00:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177751, 1102274, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sign of the times - staring at phones while waiting.  Lovely anachronism with the paper!</td>', 'The sign of the times - staring at phones while waiting.  Lovely anachronism with the paper!', '2014-02-17 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177752, 1102893, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Great catch!</td>', 'Ha!  Great catch!', '2014-02-17 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177754, 1102787, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, priceless.  The dog in the basket takes the cake (is that all the same dog??)  Well, not just that dog, but also the one being cuddled.   And the kid with the pacifier.  And the glop of all those bubbles on the sidewalk.  Amazing.  Really.</td>', 'Oh, priceless.  The dog in the basket takes the cake (is that all the same dog??)  Well, not just that dog, but also the one being cuddled.   And the kid with the pacifier.  And the glop of all those bubbles on the sidewalk.  Amazing.  Really.', '2014-02-17 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177755, 1102826, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awwwww!</td>', 'Awwwww!', '2014-02-17 00:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177756, 1102925, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks so weary.  Life lived too fast already.</td>', 'She looks so weary.  Life lived too fast already.', '2014-02-17 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177757, 1102869, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I like the way her hair falls across her face - she''s so earnest in trying to stay small.</td>', 'Cute!  I like the way her hair falls across her face - she''s so earnest in trying to stay small.', '2014-02-17 00:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177758, 1102841, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an adorable child - the raindropped bokeh really adds nicely to this.</td>', 'What an adorable child - the raindropped bokeh really adds nicely to this.', '2014-02-17 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177760, 1102522, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s not exactly happy with you, I don''t think.  Great expression, both in his face and his body language!</td>', 'He''s not exactly happy with you, I don''t think.  Great expression, both in his face and his body language!', '2014-02-17 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177785, 1102454, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Your title is the first thing I noticed, before I even read your title.  Which means it''s perfect.  And it looks darn cold...</td>', 'Ha!  Your title is the first thing I noticed, before I even read your title.  Which means it''s perfect.  And it looks darn cold...', '2014-02-17 00:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177786, 1102928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  What a great expression!</td>', 'Ha!  What a great expression!', '2014-02-17 00:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177787, 1102830, 30982, '<td valign="top">It does seem as though most of the folks are less than passionate about anything other than their phones.</td>', 'It does seem as though most of the folks are less than passionate about anything other than their phones.', '2014-02-17 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177788, 1102401, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an odd photograph.  Does the collar protect the animal in some way, as the gent with the gun (if that is a gun?) does not seem to be paying any attention to the animal.</td>', 'What an odd photograph.  Does the collar protect the animal in some way, as the gent with the gun (if that is a gun?) does not seem to be paying any attention to the animal.', '2014-02-17 00:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177789, 1102738, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed they are - I love the almost grin/almost grimace, and especially the light.</td>', 'Indeed they are - I love the almost grin/almost grimace, and especially the light.', '2014-02-17 00:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177790, 1102835, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very south beach kinda feel - all the beautiful people out for a walk!</td>', 'Very south beach kinda feel - all the beautiful people out for a walk!', '2014-02-17 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177791, 1102787, 133611, '<td valign="top">nice<br/>best by a long shot</td>', 'nicebest by a long shot', '2014-02-17 00:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177793, 1102901, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Will be back...<br/> <br/>And I''m back! A few days later than I thought, but I''ve been babysitting. I gave this a 9, my second-highest in the challenge after Lev''s. It''s amazingly genuine and complete. Winogrand, to me, captured what may look at first to be special moments, but those moments were really only the vehicle to tell the entire life story of those individuals. I feel like I know everything about the people in his photos. They weren''t one-off moments, lucky snaps, interesting only because of what was going on right then. I think they tell an entire story. And I think this tells an entire story. Beautifully done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-24 13:01:28.</i></td>', 'This is excellent. Will be back... And I''m back! A few days later than I thought, but I''ve been babysitting. I gave this a 9, my second-highest in the challenge after Lev''s. It''s amazingly genuine and complete. Winogrand, to me, captured what may look at first to be special moments, but those moments were really only the vehicle to tell the entire life story of those individuals. I feel like I know everything about the people in his photos. They weren''t one-off moments, lucky snaps, interesting only because of what was going on right then. I think they tell an entire story. And I think this tells an entire story. Beautifully done.', '2014-02-17 00:58:24.000000', '2014-02-24 13:01:28.000000', 1),
(7177794, 1102274, 133611, '<td valign="top">nice shapes</td>', 'nice shapes', '2014-02-17 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177795, 1102901, 30982, '<td valign="top">A slow day.</td>', 'A slow day.', '2014-02-17 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177796, 1102853, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such a genuine portrait - nicely done.</td>', 'Such a genuine portrait - nicely done.', '2014-02-17 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177798, 1102699, 30982, '<td valign="top">The photo feels so very bleak.</td>', 'The photo feels so very bleak.', '2014-02-17 00:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177810, 1102787, 100831, '<td valign="top">this is quite entertaining.</td>', 'this is quite entertaining.', '2014-02-17 01:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177812, 1102787, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most entertaining scenes I''ve seen in ages. Heart antennas, bubbles littering the sky, flotsam on the ground, a tot interested but not overly so, a multi-dogged woman, TWO rascals... <i>and another thing</i>, she says. It''s a slice of magic here. You''ve seen it well, timed it perfectly, and thanks a lot.</td>', 'This is one of the most entertaining scenes I''ve seen in ages. Heart antennas, bubbles littering the sky, flotsam on the ground, a tot interested but not overly so, a multi-dogged woman, TWO rascals... and another thing, she says. It''s a slice of magic here. You''ve seen it well, timed it perfectly, and thanks a lot.', '2014-02-17 01:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177813, 1102821, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast of phones!  I like the car and motorcycles reflected as well.  Telling of the times.</td>', 'Interesting contrast of phones!  I like the car and motorcycles reflected as well.  Telling of the times.', '2014-02-17 01:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
