(7178133, 1102841, 28427, '<td valign="top">The water drops add a special effect. The reflection of your hand on her head is fun. Only shame is that it looks like your rubbing on her head with your knuckles while it would have been cute if you would have "caressed" her head. I know...I know... I''m nitpicking here.<br/>Great portrait Ken.</td>', 'The water drops add a special effect. The reflection of your hand on her head is fun. Only shame is that it looks like your rubbing on her head with your knuckles while it would have been cute if you would have "caressed" her head. I know...I know... I''m nitpicking here.Great portrait Ken.', '2014-02-17 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7178273, 1102816, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great title to tie it together. Overqualified, it looks, but I bet he still gets the job. Happy ending. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great title to tie it together. Overqualified, it looks, but I bet he still gets the job. Happy ending. Nice shot.', '2014-02-18 00:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
