(7178877, 1102842, 48710, '<td valign="top">Where? Handsome light standard, cast in elegant detail; nicely wrought trash bin; brick tile sidewalk; plane (?) trees; one way street....maybe Europe, but could be old town, USA.  So, a street scene, full of incidental detail.</td>', 'Where? Handsome light standard, cast in elegant detail; nicely wrought trash bin; brick tile sidewalk; plane (?) trees; one way street....maybe Europe, but could be old town, USA.  So, a street scene, full of incidental detail.', '2014-02-19 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
