(7179353, 1102583, 16148, '<td valign="top">Or the beginning of one.  Be careful!  Nice catch.</td>', 'Or the beginning of one.  Be careful!  Nice catch.', '2014-02-20 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179357, 1102915, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hard to not like this, so I didn''t even try.  It''s a very good candid portrait, though it''s not much of a Winogrand street tribute.  Not that that matters much; quite a few of Winogrand''s own pics didn''t look much like his stuff either.  Here the main character is obviously the <i>homme</i> in the beret, but the other bloke plays a significant role too.  He''s pictured and rendered in an understated way, but the photograph would be diminished without him.  7.  Thank you.</td>', 'Hard to not like this, so I didn''t even try.  It''s a very good candid portrait, though it''s not much of a Winogrand street tribute.  Not that that matters much; quite a few of Winogrand''s own pics didn''t look much like his stuff either.  Here the main character is obviously the homme in the beret, but the other bloke plays a significant role too.  He''s pictured and rendered in an understated way, but the photograph would be diminished without him.  7.  Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179361, 1102749, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is great!  After looking through all the entries this is my favorite shot.  The framing and tilt work well together.</td>', 'This is great!  After looking through all the entries this is my favorite shot.  The framing and tilt work well together.', '2014-02-20 16:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179362, 1102809, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the burst of commotion.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the burst of commotion.', '2014-02-20 16:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179363, 1102867, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the untold stories here.  The empty stools, the backs turned behind the counter, and the terrific lady with the quizzical look.  Doesn''t seem confrontational enough to ring the Winogrand bell, but he probably wouldn''t care about that so why should anyone else?  I enjoyed this picture.  7. Thank you.</td>', 'I like the untold stories here.  The empty stools, the backs turned behind the counter, and the terrific lady with the quizzical look.  Doesn''t seem confrontational enough to ring the Winogrand bell, but he probably wouldn''t care about that so why should anyone else?  I enjoyed this picture.  7. Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179365, 1102787, 16148, '<td valign="top">Fabulous candid.  So much to study in your image.  Thanks</td>', 'Fabulous candid.  So much to study in your image.  Thanks', '2014-02-20 16:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179366, 1102812, 30364, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of someone else, not Winogrand.  But I''m not sure who that someone else is.  Could well be you!<br/>I like the strange detachment of the girl, heightened by the fact that none of the other people are paying her, or you, or me, the slightest attention.  It''s not a great street photograph, but it''s a good one, and has some genuine interest.  7.  Thank you.</td>', 'This reminds me of someone else, not Winogrand.  But I''m not sure who that someone else is.  Could well be you!I like the strange detachment of the girl, heightened by the fact that none of the other people are paying her, or you, or me, the slightest attention.  It''s not a great street photograph, but it''s a good one, and has some genuine interest.  7.  Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179367, 1102702, 16148, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid.  Has me asking and answering questions about this person.</td>', 'Excellent candid.  Has me asking and answering questions about this person.', '2014-02-20 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179368, 1102925, 16148, '<td valign="top">Lovely find.  The crop and tilt might bother some but it adds to the mystery.</td>', 'Lovely find.  The crop and tilt might bother some but it adds to the mystery.', '2014-02-20 16:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179369, 1102893, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great timing!  Wonderful candid.</td>', 'Great timing!  Wonderful candid.', '2014-02-20 16:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179370, 1102522, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very engaging sort of street candid portrait.  Sometimes a camera can capture what''s not visible, or at least not noticeable, to the human eye.  The camera can characterise a person with an expression that they never really had (it might in reality have just been a moment of transition from one expression to another).  This is apparently one of those.  7.  Thank you.</td>', 'A very engaging sort of street candid portrait.  Sometimes a camera can capture what''s not visible, or at least not noticeable, to the human eye.  The camera can characterise a person with an expression that they never really had (it might in reality have just been a moment of transition from one expression to another).  This is apparently one of those.  7.  Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179371, 1102853, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very nice street portrait.  Love your composition.</td>', 'Very nice street portrait.  Love your composition.', '2014-02-20 16:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179372, 1102488, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color street work.  I can hear the sounds of the city.</td>', 'Beautiful color street work.  I can hear the sounds of the city.', '2014-02-20 16:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179373, 1102882, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph that''s not a bit like Winogrand.  I don''t care at all about that.  She does look like Annie Liebovitz, so there''s a bonus point for that.  It really is a terrific, interesting, appealing picture.  7.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely photograph that''s not a bit like Winogrand.  I don''t care at all about that.  She does look like Annie Liebovitz, so there''s a bonus point for that.  It really is a terrific, interesting, appealing picture.  7.  Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179375, 1102702, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting street candid.  She has lots of handles for the viewer to grab, and I''m not making a cheap and tasteless joke  I mean her 1950''s glamorous hairdo and makeup, her Guess shopping bag, and the pack of Marlboros (?) semi-concealed in her other hand.  She''s a striking and provocative character.  7.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is an interesting street candid.  She has lots of handles for the viewer to grab, and I''m not making a cheap and tasteless joke  I mean her 1950''s glamorous hairdo and makeup, her Guess shopping bag, and the pack of Marlboros (?) semi-concealed in her other hand.  She''s a striking and provocative character.  7.  Thank you.', '2014-02-20 16:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7179398, 1102925, 61396, '<td valign="top">+1 for the tilt</td>', '+1 for the tilt', '2014-02-20 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
