(7180295, 1102711, 76335, '<td valign="top">The emphatic title was probably unnecessary, and the picture reminds me of an extreme crop. But when all is said and done, this is, for me, one of the more memorable pieces from this challenge.</td>', 'The emphatic title was probably unnecessary, and the picture reminds me of an extreme crop. But when all is said and done, this is, for me, one of the more memorable pieces from this challenge.', '2014-02-23 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
