(7180675, 1102783, 12611, '<td valign="top">Dead center, eyes attracting eyes, and to my unsophisticated eyes, the peripheral vision is pleasing, blur and stone and textures, slick stone, and as an added bonus, people and movement in the sweet spot. Well done and congrats on the HM.</td>', 'Dead center, eyes attracting eyes, and to my unsophisticated eyes, the peripheral vision is pleasing, blur and stone and textures, slick stone, and as an added bonus, people and movement in the sweet spot. Well done and congrats on the HM.', '2014-02-24 08:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
