(7180679, 1102702, 20799, '<td valign="top">There she is, from another time! And no cell phone in sight :). I agree with the comments and you had one of my highest votes - what bothered me was the "from the hip" candid feeling (or could be a long lens). I could be wrong but I would love to see a bit of a disruption in her path. A click followed by a smile, an eye contact, or the split second before. Fabulous shot anyway, congrats on the TT!</td>', 'There she is, from another time! And no cell phone in sight :). I agree with the comments and you had one of my highest votes - what bothered me was the "from the hip" candid feeling (or could be a long lens). I could be wrong but I would love to see a bit of a disruption in her path. A click followed by a smile, an eye contact, or the split second before. Fabulous shot anyway, congrats on the TT!', '2014-02-24 08:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7180682, 1102890, 12611, '<td valign="top">Some very unique faces and a great deal of emotion. You have captured the type of human emotion that has a timeless feel.</td>', 'Some very unique faces and a great deal of emotion. You have captured the type of human emotion that has a timeless feel.', '2014-02-24 09:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7180684, 1102787, 124190, '<td valign="top">The judgments, presumptions and condemnation of people based on their looks burns me up. <br/> <br/>  Which of you know the back story?   <br/> <br/>These two women may have been school teachers in an urban area for impoverished children, devoting their life times to teaching acceptance, inclusion, tolerance and love.  They may have worked 3 jobs other than their teaching positions in order to be able to afford the time after their retirements to sit outside and make bubbles for the neighborhood kids.  They may be suffering from particular diseases that have created the swelling in their ankles that render them incapable of walking without great difficulty.  Conditions that create constant pain. Conditions they have no control over that create water retention and swelling.  They may have met each other sitting in a doctor''s office and have decided to support each other in times of need.     WAIT!   That''s not these women.   That would have been MY neighbors, who remind of these women. They remind me exactly of the two loving souls who ended their lives as shut ins because they were too frightened to leave their houses to become objects of ridicule and criticism by people like you. <br/> <br/>The only indictment I see here is the one that you have all made of your true spirits exposing yourselves for the types of people you are.</td>', 'The judgments, presumptions and condemnation of people based on their looks burns me up.    Which of you know the back story?    These two women may have been school teachers in an urban area for impoverished children, devoting their life times to teaching acceptance, inclusion, tolerance and love.  They may have worked 3 jobs other than their teaching positions in order to be able to afford the time after their retirements to sit outside and make bubbles for the neighborhood kids.  They may be suffering from particular diseases that have created the swelling in their ankles that render them incapable of walking without great difficulty.  Conditions that create constant pain. Conditions they have no control over that create water retention and swelling.  They may have met each other sitting in a doctor''s office and have decided to support each other in times of need.     WAIT!   That''s not these women.   That would have been MY neighbors, who remind of these women. They remind me exactly of the two loving souls who ended their lives as shut ins because they were too frightened to leave their houses to become objects of ridicule and criticism by people like you.  The only indictment I see here is the one that you have all made of your true spirits exposing yourselves for the types of people you are.', '2014-02-24 09:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
