(7180993, 1102787, 35321, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot!  I''ve lived in PB for 13 years and have yet to come close to shooting something as delightfully engaging as this, here or anywhere.  Bravo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-24 23:44:29.</i></td>', 'Brilliant shot!  I''ve lived in PB for 13 years and have yet to come close to shooting something as delightfully engaging as this, here or anywhere.  Bravo!', '2014-02-24 23:44:07.000000', '2014-02-24 23:44:29.000000', 0),
(7180998, 1102787, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hihosilver:</b></div><hr/><i> Gosh...I can''t remember the last time I saw a blue get a blue from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a>...WOW!  The last one I can remember would probably be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yanko</a>''s wine glass photo. Congrats to you, Lev!  ::beams:: </i></td></tr></table> Thanks Mae! Don''t know about <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yanko</a>, but <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a> has at least two of those. But certainly a very rare feat, I am delighted. </i></td></tr></table>you can count them on one hand</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Originally posted by hihosilver: Gosh...I can''t remember the last time I saw a blue get a blue from  Posthumous...WOW!  The last one I can remember would probably be  Yanko''s wine glass photo. Congrats to you, Lev!  ::beams::  Thanks Mae! Don''t know about  Yanko, but  jagar has at least two of those. But certainly a very rare feat, I am delighted. you can count them on one hand', '2014-02-25 00:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
