(7181693, 1102909, 19959, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique club..<br/> <br/>The pose is interesting but the composition lets the photo down.<br/>I can understand the challenges given this was shot from a vehicle.<br/> <br/>The traffic cone spoils the shot as it draws the eye and keeps hold<br/>of it!<br/> <br/>The slightly off horizontal composition actually adds a dynamic to the<br/>scene and works for me..<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Hello from the Critique club.. The pose is interesting but the composition lets the photo down.I can understand the challenges given this was shot from a vehicle. The traffic cone spoils the shot as it draws the eye and keeps holdof it! The slightly off horizontal composition actually adds a dynamic to thescene and works for me.. Chris', '2014-02-26 08:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
